<title>CHINA: ABN AMRO sets warrants HK red chip stocks.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sets warrants HK red chip stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank N.V. said on Wednesday it had launched 300 million American-style call warrants on shares of red chip transportation stocks.</p>
<p> Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Cosco Pacific Ltd			    0.078 shrs</p>
<p> China Merchants Holdings Int'l Co Ltd  0.170 shrs</p>
<p> Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$4.562	  PREMIUM	  25.66 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.1808	 GEARING	  2.80X</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE     29.JUL.97	 LISTING	  HONG KONG</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.MAY.98	 PAYDATE	  19.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$5.069	  LISTING DATE   22.AUG.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    20,000</p>
<p> NOTE		CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>		     ISSUER'S CHOICE</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
